sequenceDiagram
  actor Student
  participant UI as Browser UI
  participant API as Flask API
  participant Auth as Session and role check
  participant DB as SQLite
  Student->>UI: Submit cart and pickup note
  UI->>API: POST /api/orders + CSRF token
  API->>Auth: Validate session and student role
  Auth-->>API: Student identity
  API->>DB: BEGIN IMMEDIATE
  API->>DB: Read current availability and prices
  alt Any item missing or unavailable
    DB-->>API: Missing/unavailable item
    API->>DB: ROLLBACK
    API-->>UI: 409 with refresh message
  else Cart valid
    API->>DB: Insert order, price snapshots, initial event
    API->>DB: COMMIT
    API-->>UI: 201 order confirmation
    UI-->>Student: Show order code and pending status
  end
